 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$S=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "- $Q$ is a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. Also, all the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nNotice that $Q$ is not an identity matrix since the diagonal entries are not all ones.\n\n- $R$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. But some of the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are not zeros (for instance, $r_{13}=1 \\neq 0$).\n\n- $S$ is a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. Also, all the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nNotice that $S$ is not an identity matrix since the diagonal entries are not all ones.\n\nTherefore, only $Q$ and $S$ are diagonal matrices."} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "09fa0899-a3d2-584f-8cdd-a471f8cfd16b" :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186569059 :question-generator/id #uuid "cbbe5fa4-1523-56b2-b4f5-854421bd0bad" :question-generator/script "generators/b7/b77a61d89788a1f13c5a67f4acf42b1f87a63f49e9b5d6d49b8b9f175ba39210/generator.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087985 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e85640f4-78cf-530b-b7b2-0f2d749a6b9c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459413} {:answer/id #uuid "0ef6a791-fd28-55d2-9d90-ee0d6e5ee563" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459414}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186459413} :answer-field/id #uuid "11818f42-a662-5c15-b944-33554a3f55d5" :answer-field/key "H" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460573} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9ae8fec0-a87f-566a-a0db-e87bad