agonal entries are not all ones.\n\nTherefore, only $H$ and $M$ are diagonal matrices."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186400205 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e4c4b6f3-a9d9-5370-8991-9303e65c3015" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472550} {:answer/id #uuid "d564422c-47a5-5ab6-8593-71deb3c3cd69" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472551}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186472550} :answer-field/id #uuid "8b5d220c-18b5-57e7-a90d-58d07571e262" :answer-field/key "P" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473670} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8657c195-208d-54ba-8639-f23613e3b183" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472552} {:answer/id #uuid "9a555d27-4f3f-5c78-ba86-d3dbf70f47af" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472553}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186472552} :answer-field/id #uuid "3ea2960f-36ab-5c79-bcb0-d8d666e973a1" :answer-field/key "Q" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473671} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f0bdef0e-9550-5f87-ab43-3dab5f492509" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472554} {:answer/id #uuid "5ded35e1-51c9-575b-8ae1-105fd098c53b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472555}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186472554} :answer-field/id #uuid "55893052-4f9b-5d44-8cc1-a03cc42802a9" :answer-field/key "R" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473672}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "8674af78-bd5e-58b6-917b-e86f01702cc2" :question/math-academy-id "q-126222" :question/problem "Which of the following are diagonal matrices?\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0\\text{ }\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Q=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- $P$ is *not* a diagonal matrix since it's not a square matrix.\n\n- $Q$ is *not* a diagonal matrix since it's not a square matrix.\n\n- $R$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. But some of the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are not zeros (for instance, ${r}_{31}=7\\ne 0$).\n\nTherefore, none of the given are diagonal matrices."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186403300 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "24e354b0-5651-5594-b600-5157d60ee1a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473230} {:answer/id #uuid "28c40711-ea8e-5ff4-b320-4746003a1ba1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473231}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186473230} :answer-field/id #uuid "44b3ac7f-42db-5817-b940-ff79699394b7" :answer-field/key "R" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474010} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "96c0f227-2afe-559c-bbe1-30de827c55b8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473232} {:answer/id #uuid "52e73633-ed6b-54dd-9785-0ed9d66e64aa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473233}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186473233} :answer-field/id #uuid "35b1dcd6-aff8-5097-8c1c-012edb68e27c" :answer-field/key "S" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474011} {:answer-field/c