 matrix. It is not a square matrix: it has 2 rows and 3 columns.\n\n- $N$ is an identity matrix. It is square, every main diagonal entry is one, and every off-diagonal entry is zero.\n\n- $P$ is an identity matrix. It is square, every main diagonal entry is one, and every off-diagonal entry is zero.\n\nTherefore, only $N$ and $P$ are identity matrices."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186568922 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08ef2289-f91e-51ed-963f-d0c4cdf85c7c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568902} {:answer/id #uuid "cac55895-5084-5d25-aa5a-af919b6b7400" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569030}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186569030} :answer-field/id #uuid "1630bab9-0849-50f8-b5ac-d394dc1848ec" :answer-field/key "M" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568916} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8ba8e3d1-a08a-5c1b-9932-f7da58b04e8c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568991} {:answer/id #uuid "ac43b27c-0d60-5044-b412-59893721d870" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569012}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186568991} :answer-field/id #uuid "9cfaa159-c4cc-50fb-90cb-33f51c757767" :answer-field/key "H" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569002} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6ec6e538-5559-5503-be15-77f01d3a3fc6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568971} {:answer/id #uuid "f607b139-5dcc-5cd3-bfef-9e0291f54f01" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569056}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186569056} :answer-field/id #uuid "b6e601d7-5d66-53da-9134-9ff90ecbe165" :answer-field/key "F" :answ