trix: it has 2 rows and 3 columns.\n\n- $H$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It is not a square matrix: it has 2 rows and 3 columns.\n\n- $M$ is a diagonal matrix. It is square and every off-diagonal entry is zero.\n\nTherefore, only $M$ is a diagonal matrix."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186568933 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "279c8472-08e5-5b9d-a958-06fd0adaacfe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568924} {:answer/id #uuid "c91bb09c-352d-5758-aec9-e30fd89a6872" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569028}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186568924} :answer-field/id #uuid "0297dfc6-308a-5427-9837-5f33ae1de928" :answer-field/key "H" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568900} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "62e696b4-4b90-522d-ab38-672b674631a6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186568959} {:answer/id #uuid "a3a327e0-f999-5ee2-9922-0e59a6e6c301" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569006}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186569006} :answer-field/id #uuid "e2abe842-4507-5616-8f09-83f7d643985b" :answer-field/key "F" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569050} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a0d1f53a-b068-5887-a489-7a62bd8e6b0f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569003} {:answer/id #uuid "cbf6d39d-bd95-5c90-9645-3e80af42b204" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569032}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186569032} :answer-field/id #uuid "f88d7264-a83a-5d0d-8f4b-b745cd9361d6" :answer-field/key "M" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569058}] :question/difficulty