ds matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$U=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$W=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Z=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{3} & 0 \\\\ 1 & -\\sqrt{2}\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "- $U$ is *not* a square matrix since the numbers of rows and columns are not the same. It has $2$ rows and $3$ columns, so it's a $2 \\times 3$ matrix.\n\n- $W$ is a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. It has $3$ rows and $3$ columns, so it is a $3 \\times 3$ matrix.\n\n- $Z$ is a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. It has $2$ rows and $2$ columns, so it is a $2 \\times 2$ matrix.\n\nTherefore, $W$ and $Z$ are square matrices."} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3ca13445-0218-5950-967e-a68bcfec32c7" :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510567 :question-generator/id #uuid "f20a5d14-60af-544d-9fe2-6d3be4c21992" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186087696.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087984 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "be125519-2f34-546c-b7bd-23c5ac96496b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459407} {:answer/id #uuid "8cc35c2d-cdfb-54b0-b59a-1ab2c16f4527" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459408}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186459408} :answer-field/id #uuid "e4ab1de1-f068-5a78-a108-b8e515f0ed48" :answer-field/key "C" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460570} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4c455d06-6959-5317-9e08-6a0debabe537" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459409} {:answer/id #uuid "bde4107d-ba2f-574d-b58f-38e2a03abd8b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :